## Common Mistakes to Avoid

❌ **Don't use unpadded version numbers** in filenames
❌ **Don't forget to update** main CHANGELOG.md
❌ **Don't use vague descriptions** - be specific
❌ **Don't add external links** - they break over time
❌ **Don't add implementation details** - focus on what changed, not how
❌ **Don't add usage examples** - that's for documentation
❌ **Don't add migration guides** - deploy instructions are standard
❌ **Don't add technical statistics** - focus on functional changes

